  "prefLabel": "Pda 305.04 Pilot Requirements for Appointment as a Class I or II Temporary Pilot",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 305.04 Pilot Requirements for Appointment as a Class I or II Temporary Pilot. Any person seeking an appointment as a temporary pilot shall:\n\n(a) Submit to the division a completed application form, as described in Pda 306.03, including all required certifications; and\n\n(b) Meet the requirements set forth in Pda 305.06(b)(1), (2), (4), (6), and (7).\n\nSource. #7870, eff 4-12-03; ss by #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
